comment on column company_os.fx_rates.rate_to_usd is 'Multiplier converting one unit of the currency to USD, used to derive `*_usd_cents` reporting values; refreshed opportunistically from the Frankfurter API when event P&L lines and deals are saved.';
comment on column company_os.fx_rates.updated_at is 'When the cached rate was last refreshed.';

